  "body": "v1.16.2\r\n\r\nLive\r\n- Follows a new comment on the ticket you're already watching, instead of staying on the previous one\r\n\r\nCode tab\r\n- Opening a commit from the log, or from any link to it, expands only that commit and scrolls to it, even when it's the one already open\r\n- The Diff switch stays clickable after opening a commit from the log"
